        'A new visitor can complete the supported journey, permission boundaries hold, failures have useful recovery, and one important decision is supported by tests or measurements. Explain your contribution and one limitation without overstating production readiness.',
        'How would you track interview preparation after today?',
        'Keep a short record of questions, your attempted answers, feedback, and the next drill. Revisit weak areas with new examples rather than memorizing one exact response.',
